+| Progression payoff | 9/10 | Chapter 11, Lira names five things learned in defeat; chapter 13, Cael predicts the Force woman's fourth-exchange finish; chapter 14, Lira matches and breaks the clock's pace. | Learning produces visible new capability rather than a label alone. Earlier losses and observations directly enable later success. | High |
