+| Read-aloud quality | 8/10 | Chapter 14, the clock fight from **“She gave him the first exchange”** through the fifth-exchange call. | The beat language reads with excellent momentum. Some long cumulative sentences and repeated pronouns in analytical passages demand careful emphasis, but referents are usually recoverable. | Medium-high |
+
+## Adult genre-reader lens
+
+This is also a simulated editorial lens, not a sales forecast or audience test.
+
+| Dimension | Score | Exact passage location | Reason | Confidence |
+|---|---:|---|---|---|
